                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>30 feet. The vemerak's body exudes antimagic spores. When an ongoing spell effect enters the aura, the vemerak automatically attempts to counteract it ([[/r 1d20+28 #Counteract]]{+28} counteract modifier, 7th rank). The spell effect is then temporarily immune to the vemerak's dispelling spores for 24 hours.</p>"
