                    "value": "<p>The vemerak breathes a blast of pale blue corrosive bile that deals @Damage[14d6[acid]|options:area-damage] damage in a @Template[type:line|distance:90] (@Check[reflex|dc:34|basic|options:area-effect,inflicts:sickened] save). A creature that fails its save is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 1} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 2} on a critical failure). The vemerak can't use Bile Spray again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Bile Spray]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"
